Prompt to GitHub Copilot:

can i have an OnStep method that runs continuously in the background no matter the tab

Response:

Yes. Define a plain onStep(app) with no screen prefix; it runs on every step regardless of the active screen, while a screen-specific game_onStep only runs while that screen is active. Example:

def onStep(app):
    if app.paused:
        return
    app.time += 6
    if app.time >= 1440:
        app.time = 0
        app.date += 1
    if app.date >= 7:
        app.gameOver = True

Move the time and day logic from game_onStep into this function so the clock keeps running on other screens. Keep game_onStep for logic that should run only while the game screen is showing.
